{
  "about": "Where a route's parentRef leads, as both halves resolve it: parent_at in src/tauri/src/commands/connections/traffic.rs (the Connections chain and the map) and parentAt in src/ui/lib/route-trace.ts (the Routes trace, its rows, the board and the map's route verdicts). A Gateway parent is found by name and namespace. A ListenerSet parent is found through the Gateway that keeps it, or else through the set itself, whose parentRef names its Gateway: a set that is there leads to that Gateway, and that Gateway is the one missing when it is not in the list; a set that is not there is named itself. Either is missing only where the list that would hold it was read: `null` is a list not read. `via` is the set a route went through where that set is there. Parents are written short: group defaults to gateway.networking.k8s.io, kind to Gateway, namespace to the route's.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a Gateway that is there",
      "routeNamespace": "shop",
      "parent": { "name": "edge", "namespace": "infra" },
      "gateways": [{ "name": "edge", "namespace": "infra" }],
      "sets": [],
      "at": {
        "state": "found",
        "kind": "Gateway",
        "name": "edge",
        "namespace": "infra",
        "via": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a Gateway not in a list that was read",
      "routeNamespace": "shop",
      "parent": { "name": "ghost" },
      "gateways": [{ "name": "edge", "namespace": "infra" }],
      "sets": [],
      "at": {
        "state": "missing",
        "kind": "Gateway",
        "name": "ghost",
        "namespace": "shop",
        "via": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a Gateway when the Gateways were not read",
      "routeNamespace": "shop",
      "parent": { "name": "edge", "namespace": "infra" },
      "gateways": null,
      "sets": [],
      "at": {
        "state": "unread",
        "kind": "Gateway",
        "name": "edge",
        "namespace": "infra",
        "via": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a ListenerSet its Gateway keeps",
      "routeNamespace": "shop",
